        "TileImage": "$($repository 7271eae1-6bdd-4936-b763-b2390fb07fe7).Image",
        "Description": "Good day, 47. Our client for this hit is a notorious Italian mafioso Giovanni Galcini. His nephew, Sergio Galcini, has recently moved to Vermont and soon ended up being witnessed at two assaults against women. The court is coming in several days. The witnesses are Richard and Susan Wilson for one case and local postman Dale Anderson for the second case.\r\rOur client, don Galcini, made it crystal clear that the witnesses mustn&apos;t live to the court&apos;s day. Good luck, 47. I shall leave you to prepare.",
